  upstream LICENSE and NOTICE preserved at vendor/LICENSE and vendor/NOTICE.
  Portions contributed by Steve Dakh under the MIT License; see vendor/NOTICE.

decimen-codec
  Copyright (c) 2026 Evan Crawley (Bash Alarmist)
  https://github.com/bashalarmistalt/decimen-codec
  AGPL-3.0-or-later. The prebuilt WebAssembly QR reader and its Emscripten
